      "html": "<p><img src=\"/content/images/en/attachments/4535799356955bab.webp\" alt=\"\" title=\" =189x\"> Locations of interest can be entered using the Point Dropper tool. The locations on map can be shown with different icons (i.e. MIL-STD-2525 symbols) for easy identification. The icons can also include data like notes or last seen information for additional functions.</p>\n<h2 id=\"tak-product-pages-for-tool\"><a href=\"#tak-product-pages-for-tool\">TAK Product pages for Tool</a></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>ATAK <a href=\"/doc/8fe83d8c-29e4-44aa-9f59-6c72157323a1\">Point Dropper tool</a></li>\n</ul>"
